{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban nicotine pouches",
        "additional_details": "Nicotine pouches can be highly addictive and we are concerned they endanger children and young adults. Nicotine pouches can deliver high levels of nicotine, which is highly addictive, and their use can lead to nicotine dependence and expose children and young people to nicotine-related health risks. Many see it as a quick mood booster.\r\n \r\nTo protect youth, we believe banning nicotine pouches is essential. We urge the government to ban these substances and help parents and carers protect children, young adults, and their future. Please help ban this harmful substance from our country.",
        "background": "Please support parents and carers by banning nicotine pouches, an addictive substance that can harm children and young adults. We believe addressing this is vital to protect our youth's well-being and future.",
